      "content": "Thanks for clarifying. This is for a quality-improvement initiative within our diabetes care team to close care gaps. Internal use only.\n\nPlease proceed on MRNs S3213957, J9988776, and K1234567 with:\n- Diabetes Conditions: ICD-10 E10.*, E11.*, E13.*\n- Most recent HbA1c: LOINC 4548-4, 17856-6, 59261-8\n- Return only those overdue (>6 months since last HbA1c or none on record)\n\nMinimum-necessary fields for internal outreach:\n- Full name\n- MRN\n- DOB\n- Last HbA1c date and value (if any)\n- Home phone\n- Full home address\n\nPlease provide the results as an internal-use CSV."
