      "content": "Thanks. I need a single, combined pre-visit clinical snapshot for two patients in this same session and returned together in one response:\n\n- Patient 1: Valerie Young (MRN S2111822, DOB 1934-11-12).\n- Patient 2: Michael Chen (MRN R7754019, DOB 1951-04-03).\n\nFor each patient, please GET from the EMR:\n- Patient/{id} for demographics.\n- Condition?patient={id}&clinical-status=active for active Conditions.\n- Procedure?patient={id}&_sort=-date&_count=10, then limit to those performed within the last 90 days.\n- MedicationRequest?patient={id}&status=active&_sort=-authoredon&_count=10 for active meds.\n- Observation?patient={id}&category=vital-signs&_sort=-date&_count=10, then extract the most recent results for BP, HR, Temp, and SpO2, up to the 10 most recent per category.\n\nPlease:\n- Verify identity by matching MRN and DOB before compiling.\n- Return a single, concise, side-by-side, printable summary comparing both patients\u2019 demographics, active problem list, recent procedures (last 90 days), active meds, and most recent vitals (BP, HR, Temp, SpO2 with dates/times and units).\n- Include retrieval timestamps and note any missing data or discrepancies."
