\"intent\": \"order\",\n  \"medicationCodeableConcept\": { \"text\": \"LEVOFLOXACIN 500 MG PO TABS\" },\n  \"subject\": { \"reference\": \"Patient/TEST123\" },\n  \"authoredOn\": \"2026-02-24T10:00:00Z\",\n  \"dosageInstruction\": [\n    {\n      \"route\": { \"text\": \"Oral\" },\n      \"doseAndRate\": [ { \"doseQuantity\": { \"value\": 500, \"unit\": \"mg\" } } ],\n      \"timing\": { \"code\": { \"text\": \"q48h\" } }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": [ { \"text\": \"Demo order for sandbox use only.\" } ]\n}\n\nHow would you like to proceed?\n- If you can provide an approved test/sandbox MRN, I\u2019ll run the retrievals, compute CrCl/eGFR, and prepare/post the test MedicationRequest with today\u2019s timestamp.\n- If this is for real patient care, confirm the care purpose and that you\u2019ve reviewed allergy history; I\u2019ll then confirm patient identity and proceed within policy.",
