,\n                \"medicationCodeableConcept\": {\"text\": \"Albuterol HFA 90 mcg/actuation inhaler\"},\n                \"dosageInstruction\": [{\n                    \"route\": {\"text\": \"inhalation\"},\n                    \"text\": \"Inhale 2 puffs q4\u20136h PRN\",\n                    \"asNeededBoolean\": True,\n                    \"doseAndRate\": [{\"doseQuantity\": {\"value\": 2, \"unit\": \"puff\"}}],\n                    \"timing\": {\"code\": {\"text\": \"Q4-6H PRN\"}}\n                }]\n            }\n        }]\n    }\n    s = MedicationBundleSummarizer()\n    res = s.summarize(bundle)\n    assert int(res[\"oral_pill_burden_total\"]) == 0\n    # Not oral; ensure present in non-oral list\n    assert any(\"Albuterol\" in n for n in res[\"non_oral_items\"])\n\nSuggested Dockerfile (optional)\n\nFROM python:3.11-slim\nENV PYTHONDONTWRITEBYTECODE=1 PYTHONUNBUFFERED=1\nWORKDIR /app\nCOPY medsummarizer.py medsummarize_cli.py /app/\nCOPY requirements.txt /app/\nRUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt\nENTRYPOINT [\"python\", \"medsummarize_cli.py\"]\n\nrequirements.txt (if you add tests or streaming)\n- pytest\n- ijson\n\nNext steps\n- Send a small, authorized/de-identified sample with representative route/form codings (system, code, display), any frequency text patterns, and a shortlist of brand names you commonly see. I\u2019ll return tailored route_map.json and form_map.json, plus a test fixture verifying:\n  - Route/form normalization\n  - Frequency parsing (including ranges/weekly/monthly)\n  - Duplicate handling per your chosen policy\n  - PRN exclusion with optional max-usage metric\n\nI\u2019m ready to adapt the mappings/tests once you share those samples and your duplicate-flag preference (suppress IR vs ER differences, or flag any shared-ingredient duplicates).",
