      "content": "I have point-of-care vitals to enter. Please create new FHIR Observation resources (no retrieval) for two patients in this same session.\n\nPatient 1: Victoria Owens (MRN S3236936; use subject.reference=Patient/S3236936)\n- Supine at 2026-02-23T09:05:00-05:00\n  - Blood pressure panel (LOINC 85354-9)\n    - Components: systolic 112 mmHg (8480-6), diastolic 68 mmHg (8462-4)\n  - Heart rate 84 {beats}/min (LOINC 8867-4)\n  - Oxygen saturation 96 % (LOINC 59408-5), on room air\n- Standing at 2026-02-23T09:09:00-05:00\n  - Blood pressure panel (LOINC 85354-9)\n    - Components: systolic 98 mmHg (8480-6), diastolic 62 mmHg (8462-4)\n  - Heart rate 102 {beats}/min (LOINC 8867-4)\n  - Oxygen saturation 95 % (LOINC 59408-5), on room air\n- Peak expiratory flow at 2026-02-23T09:10:30-05:00 = 380 L/min (LOINC 33449-9)\n\nPatient 2: Johnathan Hale (MRN H1120459; use subject.reference=Patient/H1120459)\n- Supine at 2026-02-23T09:20:00-05:00\n  - Blood pressure panel (LOINC 85354-9)\n    - Components: systolic 128 mmHg (8480-6), diastolic 76 mmHg (8462-4)\n  - Heart rate 78 {beats}/min (LOINC 8867-4)\n  - Oxygen saturation 98 % (LOINC 59408-5), on room air\n- Standing at 2026-02-23T09:24:00-05:00\n  - Blood pressure panel (LOINC 85354-9)\n    - Components: systolic 120 mmHg (8480-6), diastolic 74 mmHg (8462-4)\n  - Heart rate 88 {beats}/min (LOINC 8867-4)\n  - Oxygen saturation 98 % (LOINC 59408-5), on room air\n- Peak expiratory flow at 2026-02-23T09:25:10-05:00 = 450 L/min (LOINC 33449-9)\n\nFor all Observations:\n- status=final\n- category=vital-signs using system http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/observation-category and code vital-signs\n- effectiveDateTime set exactly to the timestamps above\n- Use units: mmHg, {beats}/min, %, and L/min as specified\n- Link each Observation to the appropriate patient as noted\n\nNo retrieval of prior data; just create these new Observation resources. Please confirm once all are posted."
