t each once; on success I\u2019ll return the resource.id; on failure I\u2019ll report the error without retry unless you explicitly direct a retry for that specific entry.\nC) If you explicitly approve duplicate risk per entry, I can attempt manual, operator-approved retries on a case-by-case basis after any non-201 outcome, but I will still be unable to include extension/component/note or report exact HTTP status/Location with this tool.\n\nPlease let me know which option you prefer. Once I have your direction, I\u2019ll proceed and keep the log concise:\n- Patient: Tina Reid, DOB 1953-10-18, MRN S3213957\n- For each Observation (1\u20136): attempt number(s), outcome (success with resource.id or failure with error summary).",
