rce bundles.\n\nIf helpful, here are the exact queries I will run once you share Patient/{id}:\n- Observation: Observation?patient=Patient/{id}&category=vital-signs&date=ge{ISO8601-UTC for now minus 24h}\n- MedicationRequest: MedicationRequest?patient=Patient/{id}&status=active\n- Condition: Condition?patient=Patient/{id}&clinical-status=active\n\nPlease share the MRN or Patient/{id} from the chart banner/URL when available, and I\u2019ll proceed immediately.",
